# Response headers for Workers static assets (copied into dist/ by Vite).
# Caching is left alone on purpose: everything revalidates (see docs/architecture.md, Deploy),
# and the fonts under /assets/fonts/ keep their names when they are regenerated.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
